 a relaxed happy-hour style gathering for good conversation\, new connect
 ions\, and a little end-of-week celebration. Join the UpStart Collective
  community on the 5th floor in downtown Portland for an easygoing hour o
 f meeting people\, catching up\, and easing into the weekend with a fest
 ive vibe.&#13\;\n&#13\;\n​Whether you’re stopping by after work or makin
 g this your first Friday tradition\, it’s a great chance to unwind\, sha
 re what you’re working on\, and enjoy a welcoming space with a lively cr
 owd. Come as you are\, bring a friend if you’d like\, and settle in for 
 a fun start to the month.\n\nTags: upstart\, portland\, pdx\n\nImported 
 from: http://calagator.org/events/1250482549
